      "statement": "Each scored word's total is lettersPoints + lengthBonus, where lettersPoints sums per-letter values (opponent-frozen tiles excluded via an ownLetters string) and lengthBonus is (word_length - 2) * 5 computed from the full word length including opponent tiles.",
