      "id": "claim_f70ceaeb33eb49cdb82686808fd69d24",
      "statement": "hasCrossWordViolation enforces per-letter coverage on the cross axis: a run of length 1 is fine, a run of length 2..(min-1) is always a violation, and a longer run must contain a dictionary sub-run of length >= minimumWordLength covering the tile (tested forward and reversed by runContainsValidSubRunCoveringIndex).",
