      "statement": "violatesFrozenAdjacencyOnSameAxis enforces the cross-round standalone invariant: if a candidate physically abuts a prior-round frozen tile at either axis endpoint, the maximal combined same-axis run must itself be a dictionary word, and it reads only frozen tiles so unfrozen neighbors never trigger it.",
